<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following production and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for August 19-25 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		 Aug 19-25   Aug 21-27	TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		   1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    285,729.5	 n/a</p>
<p> Production	36,555.8	 n/a	 287,580.7	 n/a</p>
<p> Shipment	  24,879.0	 n/a	 158,161.2	 n/a</p>
<p> Home Market	  349.2	 n/a	   2,303.0	 n/a</p>
<p> Stocks/close   297,057.1	 n/a</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
